      "id": "ocp-deprecated",
      "level": "info",
      "places": [
        "lib/Controller/SettingsController.php:79 OCP\\IAppConfig::deleteKey(): deprecated since Nextcloud 13; use method deleteAppValue of \\OCP\\IConfig"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "1 use in 1 file of the public API that is deprecated in Nextcloud 31 to 35. The text of the tag names the replacement where it has one.",
        "  lib/Controller/SettingsController.php:79 OCP\\IAppConfig::deleteKey(): deprecated since Nextcloud 13; use method deleteAppValue of \\OCP\\IConfig"
      ]
